  "decision": "No-training extraction is an executable float32 numeric component and faithfully reconstructs the original pretrained MLP when all channels are retained. However the 128-channel-per-layer interface needed to leave room within a 10x online-body target already diverges for three tested layers (5/12 prefill, 9/12 same-token decode). Even 2,048 channels leave 1/12 wrong for each stage and project 165.49 MB if applied to all layers. Do not promote this selected-channel heuristic as a whole-model 10x inference strategy; other source-preserving decompositions need independent gates.",
